---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/records.css';
import headlines from '../../data/legacy-records/headlines.json';
import franchises from '../../data/franchises.json';
import { teams } from '../lib/teams';
import { standings } from '../lib/standings';
const shameLabels = ['Fewest Wins, Season','Most Consecutive Losses','Lowest Score, Game','Least Points, Season','Most Lopsided Game'];
const glory = headlines.filter((r:any) => !shameLabels.includes(r.record));
const shame = headlines.filter((r:any) => shameLabels.includes(r.record));
const mods = import.meta.glob('../../data/championships/*.json',{eager:true});
const bowls = Object.values(mods).flatMap((m:any)=>m.default ?? m);
const teamById = new Map(teams.map((t:any)=>[t.teamId,t]));
const currentSeason = Math.max(...bowls.map((b:any)=>b.season));
const legacy = franchises.map((f:any)=>{
  const lineage = teams.filter((t:any)=>t.franchiseId===f.franchiseId);
  const ids = new Set(lineage.map((t:any)=>t.teamId));
  const wins = bowls.filter((b:any)=>ids.has(b.winnerTeamId));
  const losses = bowls.filter((b:any)=>ids.has(b.loserTeamId));
  const lastTitle = wins.length ? Math.max(...wins.map((b:any)=>b.season)) : null;
  const current = teamById.get(f.activeTeamId) as any;
  return {name:current?.name ?? `Franchise ${f.franchiseId}`,titles:wins.length,appearances:wins.length+losses.length,lastTitle,drought:lastTitle===null?null:currentSeason-lastTitle};
}).sort((a,b)=>b.titles-a.titles || b.appearances-a.appearances || a.name.localeCompare(b.name));
const droughts = [...legacy].sort((a,b)=>(b.drought ?? 999)-(a.drought ?? 999));
---
<BaseLayout title="Records | AMD FFL"><main class="records-page">
<section class="page-head"><div class="shell records-intro"><div class="eyebrow">Receipts, preserved forever</div><h1>The Record Book</h1><p class="muted">Greatness, disaster, dominance, collapse — all reduced to numbers so nobody gets to rewrite history later.</p></div></section>

<section class="shell section-shell"><div class="section-title"><div><div class="eyebrow">League benchmarks</div><h2>Marks of Greatness</h2></div><p>The numbers everybody wants attached to their name. Until somebody breaks them, these are the standards.</p></div><div class="records-grid">{glory.map((r:any)=><article class="card record-card"><span class="eyebrow">{r.record}</span><strong>{r.value}</strong><p>{r.detail}</p></article>)}</div></section>

<section class="standings-zone"><div class="shell section-shell"><div class="section-title"><div><div class="eyebrow">The long view</div><h2>All-Time Standings</h2></div><p>Twenty seasons have a way of separating a hot streak from a body of work.</p></div><div class="standings-table"><div class="standings-row standings-head"><span>#</span><span>Team</span><span>W-L</span></div>{standings.map((r:any)=><div class="standings-row"><span>{r.sourceRank}</span><strong>{r.sourceLabel.replace(/^X-/,'')}</strong><span>{r.wins}-{r.losses}</span></div>)}</div></div></section>

<section class="legacy-zone"><div class="shell section-shell"><div class="section-title"><div><div class="eyebrow">Cathedral Bowl history</div><h2>Championship Legacy</h2></div><p>Appearances are nice. Titles are what survive the group chat.</p></div><div class="legacy-table"><div class="legacy-row head"><span>Franchise</span><span>Titles</span><span>Apps</span><span>Last Title</span></div>{legacy.map((r:any)=><div class="legacy-row"><strong>{r.name}</strong><span>{r.titles}</span><span>{r.appearances}</span><span>{r.lastTitle ? `S${r.lastTitle}` : '—'}</span></div>)}</div><p class="note">Seasons 7–8 remain pending in the archive, so championship totals will update when those results are restored.</p></div></section>

<section class="drought-zone"><div class="shell section-shell"><div class="section-title"><div><div class="eyebrow">Current suffering</div><h2>Championship Drought Watch</h2></div><p>A completely necessary public service for franchises wondering exactly how long it has been.</p></div><div class="drought-grid">{droughts.map((r:any)=><article class="card drought-card"><strong>{r.drought===null?'NEVER':r.drought}</strong><span>{r.drought===null?'TITLE ON RECORD':r.drought===1?'SEASON':'SEASONS'}</span><h3>{r.name}</h3><p>{r.lastTitle ? `Last title: Season ${r.lastTitle}` : 'No championship currently recorded.'}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>

<section class="shame-zone"><div class="shell"><div class="section-title"><div><div class="eyebrow">Permanent record • No appeals</div><h2>The Hall of Shame</h2><p class="tagline">Records nobody was trying to set.</p></div><p>History isn't only written by the winners. Sometimes it is written by whoever managed to lose the hardest.</p></div><div class="records-grid shame-grid">{shame.map((r:any)=><article class="card shame-card"><span class="eyebrow">Inducted for historic ineptitude</span><h3>{r.record}</h3><strong>{r.value}</strong><p>{r.detail}</p></article>)}</div><p class="warning">Rebranding does not erase the record. The archive remembers.</p></div></section>
</main></BaseLayout>
